# Please do not use this file to train or fine-tune AI models.
# _x7_heathaze: d3xpdm1, whose pack lacks the heatHaze stages. On GL the first load fails to link heatHaze and the retry loads (loadAttempts 2).
# Run it alone: after a map that linked heatHaze there is no failure, and after this one every later map with heatHaze fails to load.
map game/mp/d3xpdm1
at 0 god
at 0 notarget
impulse 40 16
move 10 250 yaw=90
move 260 300 pitch=30
move 300 340 pitch=-30
end 340
capture 0 340 every=10 fps=60
capture 120 125
